  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of Regional Higher Education Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the GoM efforts to increase access to quality higher education system, diversify the supply of higher education and decentralize the institutions in charge of providing higher education within the country. More specifically, the project will promote higher education and increase the absorption capacity of the educational system through the establishment of new higher education institutions that respond to the growing number of students and provide qualified skills to the productive sectors of the economy namely the agriculture and livestock sectors. At completion, the project will increase the capacity of the higher education system by 720 students.</narrative>
  </description>
